    "In the standalone version of KokoroBoxM, reading WiFi state requires this app to be running. After you quit the KokoroBoxM app, the sing-box service cannot continue to provide `wifi_ssid` and `wifi_bssid` routing rules." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "在 KokoroBoxM 独立版本中，读取 WiFi 状态需要应用保持运行。退出 KokoroBoxM 应用后，sing-box 服务将无法继续提供 `wifi_ssid` 和 `wifi_bssid` 路由规则。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
